    title: "تعليمات متفرقه و إجابات",
    content:
      '<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img data-attachment-id="190" data-permalink="https://tkmem.wordpress.com/snapchat-901284407/" data-orig-file="https://tkmem.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/snapchat-901284407.jpg" data-orig-size="1368,6493" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-title="snapchat-901284407" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://tkmem.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/snapchat-901284407.jpg?w=216" loading="lazy" width="1368" height="6493" src="https://tkmem.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/snapchat-901284407.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-190" srcset="https://tkmem.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/snapchat-901284407.jpg 1368w, https://tkmem.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/snapchat-901284407.jpg?w=63&amp;h=300 63w, https://tkmem.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/snapchat-901284407.jpg?w=768&amp;h=3645 768w, https://tkmem.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/snapchat-901284407.jpg?w=216&amp;h=1024 216w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1368px) 100vw, 1368px" /></figure>',
